{
  "text": " Me, there was a guy flipping use cards. One day, he saw a forex trader. Forex trader make more than me. I want to trade forex. So he became the forex trader. But then he saw a stock trader. Stock are easier than forex. I want to trade stock. And he became the stock trader. Then he saw Bitcoin future. Bitcoin is faster than any stocks. I want to trade Bitcoin. And he traded Bitcoin. But Goldman Sachs was on the other side of every trade. The hedge fund were stronger than him, he thought. So he switched to 0DT options. Then the hedge fund follow him there too. So he jumped to MemeCoins. And the hedge fund showed up in MemeCoin. So he thought. Maybe prediction market, Poly market, that's where I'll have an edge. And finally he traded Poly. But then Cytadel and Jup Trading were right there, cutting into his profits. And so he wanted. I want to go back, I want to go back to flipping cars. To flipping cars. That's a lesson. The edge was always in the dish. See you on eji arena.",
